WEBVTT

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:40.560
It all happened on one day when summer was nearing.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.340
That was close...

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:08.170
If the teacher found this, not only would he confiscate it, I'd be in for the lecture of a lifetime!

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:13.030
Since I've finally managed to borrow it, I'm going to take the time to enjoy it properly at home.

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:15.030
Eh?  Who's there?!

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:24.390
Nobody's there.  I know that.

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.060
Just my imagination, right?

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:41.070
M-Maybe a cat sneaked in or something?

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.780
I got what I came for, so I'm getting the heck out of here!

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:57.030
I-I'm just hearing things!  Yeah...

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.610
<i>Brother!  Brother!</i>

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:03.510
I hear nothing!  Nothing at all!

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.350
<i>Brother...</i>

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:14.560
A-A ghost!

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:19.750
<i>You've... finally come for me...</i>

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.710
<i>I've been waiting for you for so long.</i>

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:26.700
N-No!  It's not me!

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:42.120
A cute girl like this is a ghost?

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:47.700
Th-That's way way too sad!

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.100
Please leave it to me.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:55.280
I'll make sure you get to the next world.

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:12.900
<b>The Midnight Beauty</b>

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.830
Huh?  Takamizo-kun?

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:23.040
I heard he left his house in the middle of the night last night, and hasn't come back.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:27.510
Jeez, where did Hachi wander off to?

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:29.750
What's going on?

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:48.830
Speaking for myself, I'd happily spend my whole life without ever being seen in a pose that embarrassing.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.300
SIGN:  Nurse's office

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:57.360
It looks like he fell down the stairs and hit his head a little.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.310
But he's fine; he's just resting now.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.740
Thank goodness.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.820
He probably came back to get this.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.950
You awake now, Hachi?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.180
Where is that girl?

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:11.870
Girl?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.020
This girl here?

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:13.960
No!

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.380
She was so beautiful, so pure...

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:20.810
Yes!  The very ideal of a Japanese woman!

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:22.850
Who is he talking about?

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:26.140
The girl ghost who lives here at the school!

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:29.060
KANJI:  Ghost (yuurei)

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:42.010
So, Hachi made a promise to her, eh?

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:46.970
That he would see to it that she made it to the next world.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.490
What was he thinking?

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.410
Yuuma, Jun, you're not doing anything, are you?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:59.000
Come with me.  I'm going to help that girl tonight.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:06.340
OK.  That sounds fun!

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.310
I'll go with you!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:09.900
Anri-chan...

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:13.560
If you're going to help her get to the next world, you'll need to exorcise her.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.610
So you'll need somebody from the magic school!

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:17.870
I see!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.450
Wait a sec, Anri-chan...

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:24.050
You should call a specialist if you're really going to do that.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.590
It'll be fine!

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:28.650
And we don't even know if it's really true...

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.980
If it's not, then it's not!

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:35.000
It's kind of like a test of courage.  It'll be fun!

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:54.780
My little cutie, wait for me!

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.880
Kohinata-kun, that's a lot of stuff.

00:06:57.880 --> 00:06:59.500
Sumomo made me bring it.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:04.530
Sutras, rosaries, incense, magic talismans, charms...

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:06.970
There's even drums and Buddhist statues in here.

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:09.590
I can't see them being any help, though.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.560
She's just worried about you.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.550
So what did you bring, Haruhi?

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:16.940
Oh, this?

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:19.260
A magic text on exorcism...

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:21.910
I thought it might be useful for something.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:26.020
Hachi brought his camera.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.590
Yeah.  She was seriously cute!

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.160
I want a picture to remember her by.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:34.520
A souvenir photo with a ghost, huh?

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:36.960
Cheese!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.570
It was up here, eh?

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:51.160
Yeah, I was coming down the stairs...  Right there.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.130
I'm coming now to help you into the next world, OK?!

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:58.120
Hey, Hachi!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.120
What's wrong, Hachi?

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.510
The ghost!

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:09.760
For real?

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.550
That's...

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:18.710
Takamine-senpai?

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:19.540
Yes?

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:23.920
Don't scare us like that, senpai!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:28.840
Then, you were the ghost that Hachi met last night!

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:31.960
But I wasn't at the school last night.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.590
Yeah, it wasn't Koyuki-san.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:40.430
She was a bit shorter, and her hair was a slightly shorter also...

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:44.070
<i>Miss, she's here!</i>

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:45.400
So it seems.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.470
Wh-What?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:56.790
Actually, I had a bad premonition, so I put a detection spell over the whole school.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:06.680
And just now I detected someone other than you coming inside.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.300
Paella, let's go!

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:10.560
<i>Yes, Anri-sama.</i>

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:12.290
<i>Amfei!</i>

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:13.980
Anri-chan!

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:14.550
Hey!

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.040
Hey, wait!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.500
<i>Miss...</i>

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:39.260
Maybe one of the other students came to get something they'd forgotten?

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.730
Like Hachi yesterday?

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.460
That's possible...

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.350
It's her!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.910
She came to be exorcised by me!

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:47.830
Hachi!

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.090
Huh?

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:56.390
I'm outside...

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.400
What the heck?

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:06.160
There's really a ghost?

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.740
Hachi's footsteps should be there, too.

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.110
I know!

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:14.490
I think there was a spell in here to prevent a ghost from moving.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:15.500
Here it is!

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:21.310
I don't know if it will work, but I'll try.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:22.520
Ready, Soprano?

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.170
<i>Yes, Haruhi.</i>

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:30.140
<i>El Amlesvi Eldes Vi Eldesdi Al Elvioli!</i>

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:39.770
<i>I can't confirm it's effectiveness, Haruhi.</i>

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:41.570
Looks like I failed.

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:45.530
So your magic doesn't always work.

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:51.370
There's never been any magic that I've been able to master without practicing.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.030
Here?

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.480
Brother...  Why, Brother?

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.580
There she is!

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:18.050
You're... the one from yesterday.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.830
I'm here for you!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:23.320
I came to help you get to the next world!

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:30.730
That way!

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:35.600
Hachi!

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:37.970
Are you OK, Hachi?

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:43.030
This girl...

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.530
It's her!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:11:59.680
Her!

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:01.230
This is the ghost girl I saw!

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:03.610
Pretty dang cute, huh?

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:04.440
Yeah.

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.980
She is cute.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:10.890
But, Hachi, didn't you say she was wearing a kimono?

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:13.280
She's wearing our school uniform.

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:17.750
You're right, she was wearing a uniform yesterday.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.620
Maybe she changed clothes?

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.300
A ghost changed clothes?

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:25.230
From the color of her ribbon she's in our grade.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:26.840
But I don't think I've ever seen her.

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:28.660
I don't remember her.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:31.740
No!  She's not from our school!  I know it!

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:34.140
How can you be so sure?

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:37.810
I'd never miss a girl this cute!

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:38.940
Ah, right...

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.960
I'm sure she must've met with an unfortunate accident...

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.650
...that cost her her life during her time at Mizuhosaka Academy.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.920
Ah, what a tragedy!

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:52.390
I have to tell her that she's dead...

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:57.660
...or she'll wander the halls of the school for eternity!

00:12:58.230 --> 00:12:59.850
What about that "Brother"?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:07.290
She was crying and saying "Why, Brother?" wasn't she?

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:11.040
Yeah, that's what you said.

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:13.990
I see!  I figured it out.

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:16.410
She was killed by her brother.

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.410
So night after night her hatred for her brother...

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.790
Why would she come to the school?

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:23.340
She could just go to where her brother is, couldn't she?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:26.380
W-Well, uhm, you see...

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:32.870
Ignoring Hachi's wild imagination, I'm kind of interested in who she is.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.620
Yeah.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:38.760
Her sad eyes... I'm worried about her.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:50.770
Ibuki-sama, I think we should stop.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:54.500
It seems someone's noticed our activity...

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:59.260
But we must do this, no matter what.

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:00.250
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:09.630
Man, I'm sure glad Koyuki-san decided to come along too.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:13.020
OK, today we're going to exorcise her!

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:16.730
Someone's already inside the school.

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:19.240
My detection magic was triggered.

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:21.360
They've sure got guts.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.110
Let's find them and see what they're up to.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:28.910
Depending on the answer, we really may send them to the next world.

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:36.020
It's her!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:37.890
Wait!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:41.610
At times like this you shouldn't just rush in.

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.340
Then, what should we do?

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.180
Tama-chan!

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:52.120
Go find them.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.890
<i>Aye-aye, sir!</i>

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:19.870
I've lost contact with the Tama-chan I sent to the attic.

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:21.610
The roof, eh?

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:23.500
<i>Amfei!</i>

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.040
Wait, Hiiragi!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.210
Anri-chan!

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.640
What could this feeling be?

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:36.540
Such an unexpected interruption...

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.460
We're leaving, Bisaim.

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.330
<i>Yes, ma'am.</i>

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.930
I'm sure of it.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.290
It's this way.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:54.780
You're not getting away!

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:02.940
Let's go, Paella.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.510
<i>But where is the enemy, Anri-sama?</i>

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:07.940
They're hiding somewhere.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:12.400
<i>On Elmesas Luk Arsas!</i>

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:15.390
<i>Hi Ol Amedia!</i>

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.990
Capture the intruder!

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:27.500
Why?

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.620
Why?

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.230
<i>I suppose that we're intruders, too.</i>

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:33.470
Everyone!

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.440
Anri-chan?

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:37.150
R-Run away!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:48.850
It seems the person on the roof has already left.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.420
Where are you?!

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:00.820
What?

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:03.200
I got lost again?

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.440
Brother...

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:07.810
That voice!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:16.680
It's almost too late...

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.240
There you are!

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:21.830
You again...

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:24.680
What's your name?

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:26.450
Kamijou Saya.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.400
Saya-chan, huh?

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.170
That's a nice name.

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:32.810
I'm Takamizo Hachisuke.

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:35.420
Can we talk for a bit?

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.980
No, stay back!

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:42.130
If you come any closer the same thing as yesterday and the day before will happen...

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.060
Don't worry.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:49.100
I'm wearing a bunch of talismans today. so I won't faint like I did.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:51.910
No, that's not what I meant...

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:03.930
It really hurts to tell this to a cute girl like yourself, but I have to!

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:09.100
You're in an unfortunate situation right now.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.300
I know that.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:14.980
I see...

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:17.670
So you'd noticed, then.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:19.620
Then let me put it to you straight:

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.220
You're actually...

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.470
Here?!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.460
That voice!

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:39.580
It's that classroom!

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:48.400
Save me!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:49.720
It's her!

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:50.280
Yeah.

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:52.600
Wait, I'll take care of it somehow.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.050
Hey!

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:02.190
Oh my...

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:08.280
Brother... Brother!

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.850
Saya!

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:17.800
I, Kamijou Shinya, will never forgive anyone who's hurt Saya!

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:23.370
<i>Raijin!</i>

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:33.790
Wh-What is that wooden sword?

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:35.460
It looks like a magic wand.

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:37.410
It is?

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:41.190
He's a really powerful mage.

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:48.640
Brother...

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:08.640
I will be transferring into this academy's School of Magic.  My name is Kamijou Shinya.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:12.170
This is my younger twin sister, Saya.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.930
A transfer student, huh?

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:16.930
That's why she was wearing our uniform.

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:18.990
But what were you doing here this late at night?

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:22.440
W-Well... uhm...

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:27.960
It's really embarrassing, but my brother is terrible with directions.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:36.830
We were training here during the night so he'd at least be able to get to and from school on his own.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:41.550
To be honest, I don't think I get lost that easily...

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.410
Brother, your shoes.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:45.880
They're dirty.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:51.230
Yes, for some reason, on my way here I ended up in the sewers.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.210
That's...

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.130
Incredibly bad...

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:55.700
With directions...

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:58.930
But, and I suppose this is a brother's intuition,

00:20:58.930 --> 00:21:03.970
when my sister is in danger, I can tell where she is.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:04.640
Yeah.

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:06.770
So that's how you were able to find us.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:11.870
Wait... So the reason I got knocked out for two nights in a row is...

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:14.820
Hey, I know you!

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:18.240
You're the pervert who's attacked Saya two nights in a row!

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:19.820
No!

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:23.020
You are!

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:24.870
Receive your punishment!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:28.530
You're wrong!  I was just trying to save a lost beauty...

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:33.980
And thus a new companion joined our class.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:36.500
I am the Hand of God of Mizuhosaka Academy!

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:41.140
I'll introduce your new classmate.

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:44.720
This is Kamijou Saya, who has transfered into the magic class.

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:47.550
Nice to meet you.

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:52.260
I heard your brother was coming with you...

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:56.210
Well, he got lost on his way here.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:59.170
Sensei, I know a good way to deal with this.

00:22:00.140 --> 00:22:01.870
Like this!

00:22:08.100 --> 00:22:10.420
Why you!  How dare you touch Saya?!

00:22:10.420 --> 00:22:12.240
W-Wait a minute!

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:13.510
No excuses!

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:19.490
Brother!

00:23:55.010 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.490 --> 00:23:57.090
I'm Kamisaka Haruhi!

00:23:57.090 --> 00:24:02.130
A preview is supposed to explain the contents of the next episode in a brief and efficient manner, isn't it?

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:06.540
And so this time I'm going to tell you all the good parts coming up!

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:09.350
The next episode features a mysterious transfer student.

00:24:09.350 --> 00:24:10.430
Mysterious?

00:24:10.430 --> 00:24:15.520
W-Wouldn't that mean I can't explain it completely?

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:18.010
Yeah, it definitely would!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:21.060
But if I don't explain it then it's not really a preview...

00:24:19.540 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>A Mysterious Transfer Student</b>

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:24.970
Oh, what should I do?
